{"forumTopic": {"authorId": 368073, "authorThumbnailName": "368073-kg.jpg", "authorUserDisplayName": "Bridgeport", "authorUserName": "bridgeport", "comments": [{"id": 3434200, "postDate": "2026-04-02T17:48:22.810Z", "rawMarkdown": "You can reset as many times as you like. This will reset the level and bring you back to the beginning of the level your on. Your action count will increment (it doesn't reset).", "content": "<p>You can reset as many times as you like. This will reset the level and bring you back to the beginning of the level your on. Your action count will increment (it doesn't reset).</p>", "replies": [{"id": 3434250, "postDate": "2026-04-02T18:48:45.253Z", "rawMarkdown": "Thank you so much! I am trying to understand how [random agent](https://www.kaggle.com/code/inversion/arc3-sample-submission-random-agent) is evaluated. Is there limit on number of actions?", "content": "<p>Thank you so much! I am trying to understand how <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/inversion/arc3-sample-submission-random-agent\" target=\"_blank\">random agent</a> is evaluated. Is there limit on number of actions?</p>", "replies": [{"id": 3434258, "postDate": "2026-04-02T19:01:02.677Z", "rawMarkdown": "Nope, no limit, but the more actions you do the lower your efficiency will be. Random agent did ~6.5M actions in early testing when maxed out on compute", "content": "<p>Nope, no limit, but the more actions you do the lower your efficiency will be. Random agent did ~6.5M actions in early testing when maxed out on compute</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Greg Kamradt", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/20639391-kg.jpg?t=2024-05-01-00-21-09", "url": "/gregkamradt", "tier": "EXPERT", "id": 20639391, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "HOST", "votes": {"totalVotes": 3, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 3}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 2789, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"t