:17.310Z", "rawMarkdown": "It looks like whenever we get \n\n```\nfrom arcengine import GameAction, GameState\n\nGameState.GAME_OVER\n```\nwe can call ```GameAction.RESET```\n\nHow many time can we play game for evaluation purposes? Is there limit on number of steps?", "content": "<p>It looks like whenever we get </p>\n<pre><code>from arcengine import GameAction, GameState\n\nGameState.GAME_OVER\n</code></pre>\n<p>we can call <code>GameAction.RESET</code></p>\n<p>How many time can we play game for evaluation purposes? Is there limit on number of steps?</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Bridgeport", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/368073-kg.jpg", "url": "/bridgeport", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 368073, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "TOPIC", "votes": {"totalVotes": 2, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 2}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 2471, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Bridgeport", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/368073-kg.jpg", "url": "/bridgeport", "userName": "bridgeport", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 368073, "profileUrl": "/bridgeport", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 368073, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, "firstMessageId": 3434098, "forumId": 10403401, "forumName": "ARC Prize 2026 - ARC-AGI-3", "id": 687187, "name": "How long can we play a game.", "parentName": "arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3", "parentUrl": "/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3", "postDate": "2026-04-02T15:35:17.308778Z", "totalVotes": 2, "url": "/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3/discussion/687187", "totalMessages": 3, "authorPerformanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "authorProgressionOptOut": false}}